      "text": "def intervalDiscrepancyClosedThreshold (k : Nat) (delta beta sigma T : Real) : Real :=\n  densityIterationClosedThreshold (intervalDiscrepancyStepThreshold k delta beta T)\n    (beta / (8 * boundaryRefinementConstant (beta / 64))) (sigma / 16) ⌈(beta / 8)⁻¹⌉₊\n",
      "url": "https://github.com/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/blob/af74fb522c24a6331886b11db76942642a6a0e42/Combinatorics/Ramsey/Lean/GowersSzemeredi/Proofs18GeneralIteration.lean#L11-L13"
