      "start_line": 14,
      "text": "def intervalDiscrepancyStepThreshold (k : Nat) (delta beta T : Real) : Real :=\n  max (k : Real) (max T (max (32 / beta) ((512 * (k : Real) ^ 2 + 1) / delta ^ k)))\n",
      "url": "https://github.com/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/blob/af74fb522c24a6331886b11db76942642a6a0e42/Combinatorics/Ramsey/Lean/GowersSzemeredi/Proofs18GeneralIterationStep.lean#L14-L15"
