      "text": "def quadraticExponentialThreshold (alpha : Real) : Real :=\n  Real.exp ((4 + 6 * section5LocalRefinementConstant 2 1) *\n    (2 / alpha) ^ (12380 * 2048 + 24744 : Nat))\n",
      "url": "https://github.com/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/blob/af74fb522c24a6331886b11db76942642a6a0e42/Combinatorics/Ramsey/Lean/GowersSzemeredi/Proofs18QuadraticDichotomy.lean#L10-L12"
