      "start_line": 438,
      "text": "def section13Q (alpha : Real) : Real :=\n  (2 : Real) ^ ((2 : Nat) ^ 20) *\n    alpha ^ (-((2 : Real) ^ (21 : Nat)))\n",
      "url": "https://github.com/VladimirReshetnikov/ProveIt/blob/af74fb522c24a6331886b11db76942642a6a0e42/Combinatorics/Ramsey/Lean/GowersSzemeredi/Sections12_13.lean#L438-L440"
